'''''Witch's Mirrored Reversal''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Through the Petals in the Land of Repose]].

==Steps==
# Listen to Herta talking to herself
# Give an order to the First Mirror
# Give an order to the Second Mirror
# Give an order to the Third Mirror
# Return to the First Mirror and prepare for the warp jump
# Continue forward to locate Amphoreus's entrance
# Check the surroundings for remnants of memories
# Investigate the strange basin

