{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Seclusion Zone|Be grateful, Astral Express. Fortunately, Madam Herta is quite interested in Amphoreus and plans to conduct an on-the-ground investigation there.<br />Madam Herta, could you speak with me, the Fourth Mirror, a little more?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
