;(Talk to Welt Yang)
----
:'''Welt:''' Thank you, Madam Herta. Companions are the lifeblood of the Astral Express. When things are settled, we will repay you for all your help.
:'''Herta:''' (Welt... This young man sure is courteous.)

;(Talk to Sunday)
----
:'''Sunday:''' Madam, watching you work has been an enlightening experience for me. It's hard to imagine that an outstanding scholar like you could maintain such a... relaxed manner most of the time.
:'''Sunday:''' Your calm and collected nature is truly a trait that I should learn.
:'''Herta:''' (This brat... Why does everything that comes out of his mouth sound so snarky?)
{{Dialogue End}}

===Give an order to the First Mirror{{subst:void|<!--104031003-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
