===Continue forward to locate Amphoreus's entrance{{subst:void|<!--104031007-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Vortex of Genesis|update|Learn from this, Astral Express. Madam Herta doesn't need to traverse obstacles in the flesh to personally visit Amphoreus. She can immediately uncover the secrets of this unknown world with just a simple touch.<br />Don't ask me why I'm so sure &mdash; it's because I've been a Heritor for so long.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Herta:''' Agh... I didn't expect it to be so turbulent. I should have asked the Second Mirror to use slightly less power.
:'''Herta:''' Oh... What a magnificent sight. Is this the entrance to Amphoreus?
:'''Herta:''' Let's see. Perhaps I'll be able to find a way in?
